      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Aphelios has 5 different activated abilities, based on his main-hand weapon: Calibrum (Rifle): Long range shot that marks its target for a long-range follow-up attack. Severum (Scythe Pistol): Run fast while attacking nearby enemies with both weapons. Gravitum (Cannon): Root all enemies slowed by this weapon. Infernum (Flamethrower): Blast enemies in a cone and attack them with your off-hand weapon. Crescendum (Chakram): Deploy a sentry that shoots your off-hand weapon.",
      "summary_zh": "厄斐琉斯拥有5个不同的主动技能，基于他的主手武器： 通碧(步枪)：长距离射击，能够标记目标来跟进一次长距离攻击。 断魄(短镰枪)：在快速奔跑的同时用两把武器攻击附近的敌人。 坠明(加农炮)：禁锢被这把武器减速的所有敌人。 荧焰(喷火器)：引爆锥形范围内的敌人并用你的副手武器攻击他们。 折镜(飞轮刃)：部署一个装备着你副手武器的驻灵。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1413660:3963883"
      ]
    },
